Warning [L0515] (process_args_view): The direct process.argv().skip(1) projection repeats the process argument view
  --> process_args_view.jet:6:28
    |
  6 |     args :: process.argv().skip(1)
    |                            ^^^^
 Why: process.args() owns the program argument view after argv[0], so the boundary stays in one Core API
 Fix: Replace process.argv().skip(1) with process.args()
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0515
